      <th scope="row" id="parity-grand-summary-Sum" class="gt_first_grand_summary_row_bottom gt_row gt_left gt_stub gt_grand_summary_row">Sum</th>
      <td headers="parity-grand-summary-Sum parity-x" class="gt_first_grand_summary_row_bottom gt_row gt_right gt_grand_summary_row">1234.3178</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row" id="parity-grand-summary-Max" class="gt_row gt_left gt_stub gt_grand_summary_row">Max</th>
      <td headers="parity-grand-summary-Max parity-x" class="gt_row gt_right gt_grand_summary_row">1234.5678</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
  '''
